{"about_the_game":"Explore an incredible virtual world set up high in the skies. Develop your base, defend it from enemies, join clans and make alliances. The game is inspired by the epic browser game,  Sky2Fly. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuild up an unassailable fortress, enclose it within walls and and set turrets and traps in a true tower defense game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, attack is the best form of defense! So, attack and crash your enemies in this free MMO RTS, and explore the open 3D world in a PvE mode. With a cast of charismatic characters, various monsters, intrigues and sinister secrets, it is sure to appeal to most inquisitive players!  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs the captain of a flying ship, you will battle other players, and find new friend and enemies. There are thousands of floating islands, and your aim is to ravage them all! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGAME FEATURES<br />\r\n\u2714 Take a journey into the Steampunk world of MMO RPG and RTS<br />\r\n\u2714 Enjoy amazing 3D art<br />\r\n\u2714 Build up your cloud village to an unbeatable empire<br />\r\n\u2714 Develop your own winning strategy<br />\r\n\u2714 Battle online PvP mode<br />\r\n\u2714 Defend yourself from multiplayer clan wars<br />\r\n\u2714 Struggle with players worldwide and earn trophies<br />\r\n\u2714 Create alliances, hire troops, and join the battle!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"bfddac4b7369dd99ff1e5d1ccf86b434a644026e.jpg","localized_name":"Gold Storage","name":"Gold Storage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/630140/bfddac4b7369dd99ff1e5d1ccf86b434a644026e.jpg"},{"icon":"ae35d4dc6f8044696071abd3bd7b3fcbed1e2265.jpg","localized_name":"Cleaner","name":"Cleaner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/630140/ae35d4dc6f8044696071abd3bd7b3fcbed1e2265.jpg"},{"icon":"a6b719cc2dca34b181fc76a9eb835d29d4ba4317.jpg","localized_name":"All the King's Men","name":"All the King's Men","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea